# The site is STATIC — Vercel just serves the committed HTML you push. None of
# the build-side files are needed on the deployment, so keep them off it.

# ── SECRETS — never deploy ────────────────────────────────
google_credentials.json
google_token.json
service_account.json
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
service_account*.json
secrets*.json

# ── Server-side generators & caches (not needed by the static site) ──
*.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.gs
requirements.txt

# ── Raw data / state JSON (already baked into the HTML; no need to serve) ──
*_history.json
*_snapshot.json
*_snapshots.json
timed_offers_config.json
month_boundary.json

# ── OS junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
